The agent logos in this directory come from lobe-icons
(https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons, package @lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.95.1),
with the width and height set to 24 and the inline style removed, except jules.svg,
which comes from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org, package simple-icons 16.34.0,
released under CC0 1.0) with the width, height and fill set, and omp.svg, which is
the icon of Oh My Pi (https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi, assets/icon.svg, MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner, (c) 2025-2026 Can Bölük, (c) 2026
Stencil Labs, Inc.) redrawn in one color on a square canvas. The logos are
trademarks of their respective owners and are used only to tell which agent is
running in a terminal.

